# Static-analysis cache (Snyk / DeepCode)
.dccache

# Captured data of real networks must never be committed: a pcap of someone's
# airtime is other people's traffic, and a recovered password is a credential.
# Only the synthetic fixtures the tests build from hex literals belong in git —
# they carry no real traffic and no real credential.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.22000
*.22000.txt
handshakes/
cracked/
passwords*.txt
secret*.txt
